♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:49,209
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:53,538
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,563 --> 00:00:54,031
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl")

11
00:00:54,055 --> 00:00:54,545
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:55,867
=Episode 25=

13
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,000
Coming through!

14
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:01,679
Sorry! I didn't mean to.

15
00:01:01,679 --> 00:01:02,560
I'll make it up to you later.

16
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,400
Watch it.

17
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,319
I just bought the same flavor.

18
00:01:12,344 --> 00:01:13,719
I haven't tried this one yet.

19
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,599
Here, take it.

20
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,599
Thanks!

21
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:17,599
I'll transfer the money to you.

22
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,359
No need.

23
00:01:18,359 --> 00:01:19,560
Maybe we'll meet again someday.

24
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,439
Then buy me a coffee.

25
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,840
Pretty and kind-hearted.

26
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:29,800
Have you heard?

27
00:01:29,825 --> 00:01:30,207
What is it?

28
00:01:30,232 --> 00:01:32,239
A very important guest just arrived.

29
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:33,760
She went straight
into Mr. Duan's office.

30
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,079
She's Mr. Duan's fiancee
from Xiangjiang.

31
00:01:37,319 --> 00:01:38,879
But somehow,

32
00:01:38,959 --> 00:01:40,079
things just fizzled out.

33
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,560
Hi there.

34
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:46,640
Fancy seeing you again.

35
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,359
Hello.

36
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,640
I'm Lu Mingye, Mr. Duan's assistant.

37
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,560
I'm here to bring him some coffee.

38
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,359
So this coffee

39
00:01:58,359 --> 00:01:59,799
was for Duan Xiuming.

40
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,200
Looks like his taste hasn't changed.

41
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,039
Big Shot Duan,

42
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,719
you're quite the busy man.

43
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,599
I've been waiting forever.

44
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,759
Weren't you coming tomorrow?

45
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:18,159
I wanted to surprise you.

46
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,319
Let me take a look.

47
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,520
How come you look even hotter
after all this time?

48
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:30,319
Xizi City really agrees with you.

49
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:33,520
You look much better
than you did in Xiangjiang.

50
00:02:33,719 --> 00:02:34,960
Haven't I always looked like this?

51
00:02:36,856 --> 00:02:38,121
(Dongchen Group)

52
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,680
You're in luck today, buddy.

53
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,599
You almost missed this coffee today.

54
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,479
Why?

55
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:49,919
It's a secret.

56
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,520
Mingye, let me introduce you.

57
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,240
This is my...

58
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:02,479
No need to introduce us.

59
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,039
Mr. Duan,

60
00:03:04,159 --> 00:03:05,599
Miss Lu and I already know each other.

61
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,120
Since you have lots to catch up on,

62
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,520
take your time.

63
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,560
I'll leave you to it.

64
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,560
Mr. Duan,

65
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,960
the documents are urgent. Sign them.

66
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:33,919
The coffee I owed you.

67
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,599
I was just saying.

68
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,639
You really took it to heart.

69
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:41,199
Miss Xia, I'm not sure
what flavor you like,

70
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,759
so I got you the same one as Mr. Duan.

71
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,560
No wonder Xiuming likes it so much.

72
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,840
It really is a unique flavor.

73
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:59,120
Mr. Duan has always been loyal
to his tastes and habits.

74
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:04,639
Do you often meet friends

75
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,919
at cafes to chat?

76
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,520
Sometimes.

77
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,680
Most of the time,

78
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,639
I read or sketch on my own.

79
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,520
Being alone does bring some peace.

80
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:15,360
But when you meet someone
on your wavelength,

81
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,120
spending your free time together

82
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,319
can be nice, too.

83
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,079
Miss Lu,

84
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,319
are you single?

85
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:29,399
That's a little personal.

86
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,040
No need to be so guarded.

87
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,319
I can tell

88
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:40,560
you two aren't just boss and assistant.

89
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:45,000
You seem very interested
in his love life.

90
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,000
Of course.

91
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:49,079
So why don't you

92
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,839
give me an answer?

93
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,040
What exactly

94
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:55,120
is your relationship now?

95
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:58,040
Why don't you

96
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,839
ask Mr. Duan directly?

97
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,800
I know his feelings for you run deep.

98
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,079
So I'd rather hear your answer.

99
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,279
I owe who I am today to him.

100
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,920
His place in my life goes

101
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,319
far beyond simple romance.

102
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,279
By the way,

103
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:33,399
could I ask you a favor?

104
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:35,240
I want to pick out a gift for someone.

105
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,800
I'd love your opinion.

106
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,360
What kind of person is it?

107
00:05:40,199 --> 00:05:42,879
A man who's very important

108
00:05:43,639 --> 00:05:44,439
to me.

109
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:48,199
(Let me take a look.)

110
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:52,360
(How come you look even hotter
after all this time?)

111
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:54,160
What do you think of bedding as a gift?

112
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,160
Bedding?

113
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,920
That's a rather personal choice.

114
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:04,839
It depends on how close you are

115
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,680
with your friend.

116
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:10,160
Given our relationship,

117
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,959
bedding wouldn't be inappropriate.

118
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:14,000
You have such a good eye for art.

119
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,839
Why not help me choose a design?

120
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:19,879
Sure.

121
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:28,399
This set has
a more subdued color scheme.

122
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,639
It suits most people's tastes

123
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,199
and is a safe choice.

124
00:06:32,759 --> 00:06:34,720
It's a good gift for someone

125
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:36,279
who values quality of life.

126
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:39,720
Then I'll take this one.

127
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,759
What's wrong?

128
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,680
New bedding?

129
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,839
Looks like good quality.

130
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,160
I didn't buy it.

131
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,040
A friend gave it to me.

132
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:15,279
Your friend has great taste.

133
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,519
The color really suits you.

134
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,040
She knows my tastes well.

135
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,879
Get some sleep.

136
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,199
I still have work to do.

137
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,360
Let's try something different tonight.

138
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,120
Still single?

139
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,000
Married.

140
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,399
Sharing a bed?

141
00:08:17,863 --> 00:08:20,583
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

142
00:08:22,090 --> 00:08:26,316
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

143
00:08:26,341 --> 00:08:30,316
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

144
00:08:30,673 --> 00:08:33,273
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

145
00:08:35,009 --> 00:08:37,369
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

146
00:08:39,176 --> 00:08:43,229
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

147
00:08:43,403 --> 00:08:47,049
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

148
00:08:47,143 --> 00:08:51,589
♪Every piece, every breath for you deep♪

149
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,159
My mom will arrive tomorrow.

150
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,279
She's been wanting to meet you.

151
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:01,879
Sure.

152
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,919
Let's pick her up together tomorrow.

153
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,279
No need.

154
00:09:07,519 --> 00:09:09,000
She's booked a restaurant.

155
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:11,120
We'll just meet her there.

156
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:13,759
Okay.

157
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:17,679
I can tell

158
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:19,919
you two aren't just boss and assistant.

159
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,879
You seem very interested
in his love life.

160
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,879
Of course.

161
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:29,879
So why don't you

162
00:09:29,879 --> 00:09:31,600
give me an answer?

163
00:09:33,639 --> 00:09:36,320
(A man who's very important)

164
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:37,799
(to me.)

165
00:09:37,799 --> 00:09:38,412
(Have you heard?)

166
00:09:38,436 --> 00:09:38,896
What is it?

167
00:09:38,921 --> 00:09:41,240
A very important guest just arrived.

168
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,679
She went straight
into Mr. Duan's office.

169
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:45,879
She's Mr. Duan's fiancee
from Xiangjiang.

170
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,360
You and Xia...

171
00:10:10,710 --> 00:10:14,670
(Voice message from Xu Suyue)

172
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:17,440
(Mingyu,)

173
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:19,840
(Duan Xiuming's at the airport
with a beauty.)

174
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,320
(They're standing
by international arrivals,)

175
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,399
(checking the time now and then,)

176
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:24,519
(clearly waiting for someone.)

177
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,919
(They've picked the person up.)

178
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:30,559
(An elegant older lady.)

179
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,480
(The beauty goes over, too.)

180
00:10:32,679 --> 00:10:33,679
(She naturally takes hold)

181
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:35,200
(of the older lady's other arm.)

182
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,679
(The three of them
were all smiles and chatter.)

183
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:37,840
(I'll send you a photo.)

184
00:10:38,190 --> 00:10:41,696
(Xu Suyue)

185
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:42,960
(Mingyu!)

186
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:45,200
(I just heard that woman)

187
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:47,559
(called that older lady "Mom" too!)

188
00:11:30,823 --> 00:11:35,416
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

189
00:11:38,003 --> 00:11:41,956
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

190
00:11:44,983 --> 00:11:49,463
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

191
00:11:50,796 --> 00:11:55,643
♪Chimes and cicadas
have been in love for so long♪

192
00:11:58,130 --> 00:12:04,683
♪A love letter written in song♪

193
00:12:04,983 --> 00:12:09,943
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

194
00:12:12,300 --> 00:12:18,446
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

195
00:12:18,972 --> 00:12:24,938
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

196
00:12:25,501 --> 00:12:29,744
♪Gemini's joy♪

197
00:12:29,768 --> 00:12:32,497
♪Lets art fill our love♪

198
00:12:33,257 --> 00:12:35,416
♪Close your eyes and count♪

199
00:12:35,707 --> 00:12:38,333
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

